  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1403.08 Scrap Metal and Salvage Materials. In all cases where scrap metal and salvage materials are purchased or sold using a vehicle scale, the quantity of the scrap metal and salvage material shall be determined by a licensed public weighmaster, and a weight certificate shall be issued to the buyer or seller.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Agr 1400) #7462, eff 3-21-01; ss by #9416, INTERIM, eff 3-13-09, EXPIRED: 9-9-09\n\nNew. #9639, eff 1-20-10; ss by #12424, eff 12-1-17 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Agr 1400)",
